#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Informationen zum IBM Quantum-Logging auf IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr "Logging für Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Logging für Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud&reg;-Dienste wie Qiskit Runtime erzeugen Plattform-Logs, die du nutzen kannst, um ungewöhnliche Aktivitäten und kritische Aktionen in deinem Konto zu untersuchen und Probleme zu beheben.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Du kannst [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) verwenden – einen Plattformdienst –, um Plattform-Logs in deinem Konto an ein Ziel deiner Wahl weiterzuleiten. Dazu konfigurierst du einen Tenant, der festlegt, wohin die Plattform-Logs gesendet werden. Weitere Informationen findest du unter [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Du kannst [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) nutzen, um Plattform-Logs, die in deinem Konto erzeugt und von IBM Cloud Logs Routing an eine IBM Cloud Logs-Instanz weitergeleitet werden, zu visualisieren und darauf basierend Benachrichtigungen einzurichten.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Standorte, an denen Plattform-Logs erzeugt werden {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry erzeugt Plattform-Logs, die in deinen Logging-Instanzen angezeigt werden. Die folgende Tabelle listet die Standorte auf, an denen die automatische Erfassung von Container Registry-Dienst-Logs aktiviert ist.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Standort                     | Plattformdienst-Logs verfügbar? |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east)   |               Ja                 |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)            |               Ja                 |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Erzeugte Plattform-Logs {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Qiskit Runtime generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Qiskit Runtime erzeugt Plattformdienst-Logs, die in deinen Logging-Instanzen für die folgenden spezifischen Fälle angezeigt werden:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Wenn sich der Status eines Jobs ändert.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Logs über die Observability-Seite anzeigen {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Informationen zum Starten der IBM Cloud Logs-Oberfläche findest du unter **Launching the UI** in der [IBM Cloud Logs-Dokumentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Felder nach Log-Typ {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Informationen zu Feldern, die in jedem Plattform-Log enthalten sind, findest du unter [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Die folgenden Felder sind im Log-Datensatz enthalten.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Feld            | Typ        | Beschreibung                                                                         |\n"
"|-----------------|------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Erforderlich | Definiert das Konto und die Flow-Log-Instanz, in der das Log veröffentlicht wird.   |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Erforderlich | Legt fest, ob IBM eine Kopie des Datensatzes für betriebliche Zwecke speichert.     |\n"
"| message         | Erforderlich | Beschreibung des erzeugten Logs.                                                     |\n"
